insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('a22aad92-4772-59c1-b995-c886842375ae', 'wg5-opinion-writing-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Swimming Lessons in Gym Class$q$, $q$(1) Our town has a public pool only three blocks from our school. (2) Every student should take swimming lessons during gym class at least once a year. (3) The most important reason is safety. (4) Knowing how to float and tread water can help a person stay calm after falling into a lake or pool. (5) Specifically, students would learn how to float on their backs and how to reach a friend with a pole instead of jumping in.

(6) Swimming is also great exercise. (7) It works the arms, legs, and heart all at the same time. (8) ______ students who have sore knees or ankles can still swim because the water supports their bodies. (9) The pool snack bar sells frozen fruit bars in the summer.

(10) Some students are nervous around deep water. (11) The lessons could start in the shallow end, where everyone can stand. (12) Every student deserves the chance to be safe and strong in the water.$q$, 'draft')
