insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('862c14a1-a005-5f3e-ae3b-375c32939d3a', 'wg5-opinion-writing-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$An Open Art Studio at Lunch$q$, $q$(1) Our art teacher, Mr. Okafor, keeps the art room locked during lunch. (2) I think the art room should be open as a studio for students two days a week at lunch. (3) Students need more time to finish their projects. (4) In art class, we only have forty minutes, and clay projects often take three or four class periods. (5) ______ many students rush, and their sculptures crack before they are done.

(6) An open studio would also give quiet students a calm place to go. (7) The cafeteria is very loud, and some kids feel worn out by the end of lunch. (8) Drawing or painting quietly could help them feel ready for afternoon classes. (9) Mr. Okafor said he would be willing to supervise if a parent volunteer helps.

(10) Clay comes from the ground and is made of tiny bits of rock. (11) An open art studio would help students finish their work and feel calm, so our school should try it this spring.$q$, 'draft')
